<title>USA: Sonic Corp Q3 May 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Sonic Corp Q3 May 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.39		    $0.34</p>
<p> Net			  5,191		    4,615</p>
<p> Revs			48,818		   40,125</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,299		   13,606</p>
<p>		 NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.94		    $0.82</p>
<p> Net			 12,758		   10,909</p>
<p> Revs		     127,924		  105,109</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,595		   13,353</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Sales at company-owned restaurants rose 23 percent in Q3 from a year ago.</p>
<p>Same-store sales for company-owned restaurants rose 8.7 percent in Q3 from a year ago. Including franchise units, same-store sales rose 9 percent.</p>
